# Passes, fails (an expectation, and a condition), and skips on purpose.
Screen: Cart

  Element: Cart Summary
    Show: Title

    When: The cart is empty
    Show: Empty message

    When: An item was added
    Hide: Empty message

    When: Coupons are enabled
    Show: Empty message

  Element: Checkout Button
    When: An item was added
    Enable

    When: The user is signed out
    Disable
